    "details": "<p>CodePuneThinkers is a 36-hour online hackathon running from 7<strong> November 2026 at 10:00 AM to 18 November 2026 at 10:00 PM IST</strong>.<br />Teams of 1&ndash;4 members will compete for a ₹30,000 prize pool, paid internships, incubation opportunities, and participant benefits.</p>\n<h3>Benefits and Opportunities</h3>\n<div class=\"blue_un-border-before comp-detail un_editor_text_live\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Top 3 teams:</strong> Paid internship opportunities</li>\n<li><strong>Top 3 teams</strong>: 30,000 prize pool</li>\n<li><strong>Top 3 teams:</strong> Incubation and product-development opportunities</li>\n<li><strong>Top 3 teams:</strong> Letters of Recommendation</li>\n<li><strong>Every eligible participant:</strong> One complimentary <code dir=\"ltr\">.xyz</code> domain</li>\n<li><strong>Every eligible participant:</strong> $100 in Inkloom AI credits</li>\n<li><strong>Every eligible participant:</strong> $500 in Adaption platform credits</li>\n<li><strong>Every eligible participant:</strong> Verifiable digital certificate</li>\n<li><strong>Rewards and benefits:</strong> 100+ recipients across the hackathon<strong><br /></strong></li>\n<li><strong>No.of Rounds: 3</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Mode:</strong> Completely online</li>\n<li><strong>Team size:</strong> 1&ndash;4 members</li>\n<li><strong>Registration fee:</strong> Completely free</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Teams selected for Round 3 pay a participation fee of ₹399 per team &mdash; one payment for the whole team, not one each. 100 teams are selected and qualified, and all of them are mailed, but seats are limited and we have only 50. Whoever pays first gets their seat reserved. The top 50 teams receive their specific rank on their certificate, written out of 1,000+ teams, and every finalist also receives a Finalist Certificate. The fee covers the cost of running the event: infrastructure, the time and effort of organising it, and paying the people who do that work. Registering and Rounds 1 and 2 are free, and this is the only payment anywhere in this event. It falls due only once your team is selected for Round 3, so a team that is not selected pays nothing at all. Paying it means accepting the event participation terms, which are linked under this block and are the same for every event.</p>",
